WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.420
Picture a desk in

2
00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:02.660
Lantern Bay with

3
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:03.960
a stack of records

4
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.540
about one project, Harbor Walk.

5
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:07.460
It's made up,

6
00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:08.920
120 homes,

7
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.710
12 described as affordable.

8
00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.420
Five of them talk

9
00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.380
about the same homes,

10
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.460
but each uses

11
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.860
different words.

12
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.100
The staff summary says

13
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.960
the developer has agreed.

14
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.020
A draft letter says

15
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.300
it will explore.

16
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.390
The slides say considering.

17
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:24.960
The minutes describe

18
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.420
an understanding.

19
00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.460
a later letter says

20
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.560
the company will provide.

21
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.540
Promise Ledger lines them

22
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.120
up on one receipt.

23
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:32.780
Only the later

24
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.020
letter is signed,

25
00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.760
only by the developer.

26
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.440
It shows what differs.

27
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.640
The staff summary says

28
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.060
60% of AMI

29
00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.340
for 30 years.

30
00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.260
The signed letter,

31
00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.600
80% for 15 years.

32
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.600
it shows what's not

33
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.360
located in these records.

34
00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:48.720
Rent limits remedies.

35
00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:49.520
Both are flagged

36
00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.980
for human review.

37
00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.680
AI reads, code checks,

38
00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:53.450
people decide.

